{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/south-living-dubai-south-dubai-south","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":422,"crm_id":"1705","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"South Living","slug":"south-living-dubai-south-dubai-south","display_address":"Dubai South","building_type":["studio","apartment"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Dubai South","price":1042525,"display_price":"1.04M","lattitude":24.9508963,"longitude":55.2260919,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>South Living, an exclusive and ambitious project from developer Dubai South, offers a place to live in a developer-designed city of the future. Buyers and investors can choose from a variety of apartments with beautiful views of the surrounding area, ensuring a comfortable stay for everyone. South Living includes <strong>studios with</strong> <strong>one, two or three bedrooms.</strong></p><p>South Living is not just an apartment complex, it is a city of the future, designed for happy and empowered people. It is an inclusive and cohesive community with a strong focus on environmental stewardship and a philosophy of mindful consumption of natural resources.</p><p>Southern Living offers elegant homes for families who appreciate a high level of comfort and style. Living spaces combine modern design with maximum comfort, and community areas designed for enjoyable family time.</p><p>South Living residents have everything they need for the perfect living experience, including a community park, supermarkets, restaurants and more. Convenient visitor parking and a magnificent double-height lobby with waterfall.</p><p>South Living is located around the world's largest airport, Al Maktoum Airport, and offers residents convenient access to Expo Road, which provides comfortable access to Dubai's iconic destinations.</p>","t